<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CelTech records H1 loss, cautions on year.</title>
<headline>CelTech records H1 loss, cautions on year.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr loss (cts)	  6.8	   vs 13.2 loss</p>
<p>    Attrib loss	     3.48	  vs 5.02 loss</p>
<p>    Net loss pre-interest 3.53	  vs 4.85</p>
<p>    Interest received     0.04	  vs 0.17 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		  0.32	  vs 0.91</p>
<p>Full name: Celtron Technologies Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The cellular phone systems distributor cautioned that it would not achieve its prospectuis forecasts for the full year. It said it would provide revised profit forecasts for the year to September 1998 at the same time as publishing preliminary results for the year to September 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
